OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785768502
OL,3,C12 people treated after potential
OL,4,Cchemical leak at leisure centre
OL,6,F12 people have been reported as
OL,7,Fexperiencing breathing difficulties
OL,8,Fafter a potential chemical leak at a
OL,9,Fleisure centre in Derby.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fcentre in Moor Lane in Allenton at
OL,13,F1.38pm on Thursday (July 30th).
OL,15,FThe leisure centre has been evacuated
OL,16,Fas a precaution while emergency
OL,17,Fservices deal with the incident.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
