OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785768502
OL,3,C12 people treated after potential
OL,4,Cchemical leak at leisure centre
OL,6,FAt present, around 12 people have been
OL,7,Freported as experiencing breathing
OL,8,Fdifficulties and are being assessed by
OL,9,Fparamedics.
OL,11,FOsmaston Park Road is currently closed
OL,12,Fto the junction with Moor Lane. People
OL,13,Fare being asked to avoid the area and
OL,14,Ffind alternative routes.
OL,16,FFirefighters from Ascot Drive,
OL,17,FKingsway, and Nottinghamshire's
OL,18,FStapleford stations are in attendance
OL,19,Fsupported by a specialist
OL,20,FEnvironmental Protection Unit from
OL,21,FStockhill.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
