OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785768502
OL,3,C12 people treated after potential
OL,4,Cchemical leak at leisure centre
OL,6,FThey are working with Derbyshire
OL,7,FConstabulary and East Midlands
OL,8,FAmbulance Service.
OL,10,FA Hazardous Area Response Team, two
OL,11,Fparamedics in solo response cars, and
OL,12,Ffive ambulances are on the scene.
